{"id":"chaleur","lemma":"chaleur","pos":"noun","rank":1506,"glosses":["heat","heat (a state of sexual aggression)"],"ipa":"/ʃa.lœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f5/Fr-chaleur.ogg/Fr-chaleur.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"chaleurs"},"formAudio":{"chaleurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-chaleurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je déteste la chaleur.","en":"I hate the heat.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Mon chat souffre de la chaleur.","en":"My cat is suffering from the heat.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"cat"},{"g":"to suffer","l":"souffrir"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"La chaleur m'empêche de dormir.","en":"The heat's preventing me from sleeping.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to stop","l":"empêcher"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to sleep"}]},{"text":"Les grandes chaleurs de l'été sont enfin là.","en":"The dog days of summer have finally arrived.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"finally"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"J'ai l'habitude de la chaleur.","en":"I'm used to the heat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102807","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"habit"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"of the"]]}]}